          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^2&=\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)^2+2\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}\\right)\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)+\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^2\\\\\\left(\\frac{3x}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^2&=\\frac{9x^2}{4}-x+\\frac{1}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
